    "confidence_note": "The analysis relies on correlational data and model-based feature importance. While trends are observed, causality cannot be inferred. The lack of statistical significance in several key tests (ANOVA for performance/satisfaction, retention association test) indicates that the observed differences are likely due to random variation or are too small to be reliably detected with the current data and sample size."
